if {verified_by_tv} == true:
	system: Congratulations. You can now return to your planet. This is a [CORE MATERIAL].
	protag: It's really this simple?
	system: No. More levels would be added in the future, the creator unfortunately has other matters to attend to currently.
	protag: Uh...sure. Like fixing the spaghetti code and working on time management?
	system: Goodbye.
	protag: You didn't deny it though.
	system: Game over.
	[signal arg="game over"]
else:
	system: Nothing to see here.